{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"25987","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:25987","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55883","characterName":"ストック","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55883","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ストック","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。アリステル情報部で屈指の実力を誇る剣士。19歳。赤い服が特徴。性格は無口で冷静沈着だが、仲間が傷つくことが何よりも嫌いで、それを防ぐためなら自己犠牲もいとわない。「白示録」を手にしたことから、過去へ戻る能力を得る。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55883"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2ef41198b3d1b12e5d81c1ca4beaf6bbd2e5fb92541b56dae6b15b5790ba3ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fea4cb90bbe4ae8f3fffc456be6549090e43623a9e72eab960f341618e4a2ed.webp","width":224,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小西克幸","creatorId":"vndb:s65","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s65","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s65","name":"小西 克幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212081:55883:3861:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55884","characterName":"エルーカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55884","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"エルーカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グランオルグ王女で、王位第一継承者。金髪の巻き髪が特徴。プロテアとの血縁関係はない。プロテアに何度も政治に関する忠告をしているが、ほとんど無視されている。密かに反政府組織であるレジスタンスに通じている。戦闘では銃で戦い、攻撃魔法や回復魔法も使いこなす。銃を飛び道具として使用するのは魔法を使用する際であり、通常攻撃時には銃身で直接殴りつける。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55884"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80e468f72ab69aa97bdc05ac68d50ca68960fbae947442102f32a0452b8de5e6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2df7e946a66ad98f5a4738d90fb0d98633866bb44dca24dc6e34862977408e04.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋李依","creatorId":"vndb:s10632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10632","name":"高橋 李依","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212081:55884:17491:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55885","characterName":"アト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55885","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅芸人一座の一員。9歳。元気が取り柄の可愛らしい少女。ストックのことを好きになり、旅に同行することを決意する。戦闘ではナイフで戦い、強力なトラップと回復を得意とする。実はシャーマンとしての資質がある。「〜なの」という語尾で話す。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55885"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/00f6280d7b995fff6afd9646e98431cddc24a3dd404be4829579df7370163cf6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ac0c953688b20a8f52fc0344b851224ebc3dcb6fab9053abfc5145a6811bdd1.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"黒沢ともよ","creatorId":"vndb:s10496","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10496","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10496","name":"黒沢 ともよ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212081:55885:9560:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55886","characterName":"レイニー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55886","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"レイニー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ストックの女性パートナー。17歳。槍を使った攻撃が得意だが、攻撃魔法も使える。所属していた傭兵団が壊滅に追い込まれた時、ハイスに拾われアリステルの情報部に派遣された。やや直情的な面がある。ストックに密かに思いを寄せており、とあるサブイベントを発生させると晴れて両想いの間柄となる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55886"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/9120086e241466b6a370a81dbe37728970896434f4b276f72eea82f886ecc2c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/9947d3806f9a40732c42a7fd60e290ae10764f3ad87a296b34553292db2416c2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉綾音","creatorId":"vndb:s3892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3892","name":"佐倉 綾音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212081:55886:5745:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55887","characterName":"マルコ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55887","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"マルコ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ストックの男性パートナー。17歳。剣を使った攻撃と、回復術を得意とする。レイニーと同じ傭兵団に所属しており、レイニーとは旧知の仲。レイニーからは「マル」と呼ばれている。しっかり者。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55887"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60644649eee1277c24aa0e5d9d9ce5404d6e9e2aceb6790628a883976531abbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30eda8edcefe0fba67d63902cb49c9247b171447c4d4c41db8f644baa6287d21.webp","width":191,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山谷祥生","creatorId":"vndb:s8331","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8331","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8331","name":"山谷 祥生","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212081:55887:13744:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_55888","characterName":"ロッシュ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55888","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"212081"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ロッシュ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アリステル軍士官。21歳。ストックが軍にいたころの戦友。高い実力を買われ、市民による志願兵の軍団長に就くことになった。左腕に魔動仕掛けのガントレットを義手として装備しているが、これは過去の戦闘で大怪我を負ったためである。槍を使った攻撃が得意。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55888"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c4e6df8809e8c08608a356acabe05cbcb6fbd9bd65610270d1dea3ab027a953.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3ab5f0e4a2f1cebedf0dd437fc6bf237dcbdbafabcf36893229f84e0ec3f7a15.webp","width":256,"height":223,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽多野渉","creatorId":"vndb:s60","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s60","canonic